Subject: [PATCH] H2.3 command governance baseline integration

This patch contains the H2.3 (H23) command governance policy integration
that establishes the baseline for H2.4 class-aware early execution.

Key changes:
- Add H23CommandGovernor for command class gating
- Add H23LiveTraceRecorder for decision continuity
- Integrate H2.3 policy with executor execution flow
- Add trace markers for decision continuity proof

